WEBVTT

00:02.127 --> 00:03.253
&gt;&gt; Are you ready, kids?
>> 孩子们，准备好了吗？

00:03.336 --> 00:05.130
All: Aye, aye, Captain!
全体：是啊是啊，队长！

00:05.213 --> 00:06.506
&gt;&gt; I can't hear you.
>> 我听不到你说话。

00:06.589 --> 00:08.341
All: Aye, aye, Captain!
全体：是啊是啊，队长！

00:08.425 --> 00:11.553
&gt;&gt; ♪ Ohh... ♪
>> ♪ 哦... ♪

00:11.636 --> 00:13.638
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.722 --> 00:15.849
All: SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：海绵宝宝！

00:15.932 --> 00:17.684
&gt;&gt; ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
>> ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.767 --> 00:19.686
All: SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：海绵宝宝！

00:19.769 --> 00:21.688
&gt;&gt; ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
>> ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:21.771 --> 00:23.732
All: SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：海绵宝宝！

00:23.815 --> 00:25.859
&gt;&gt; ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
>> ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:25.942 --> 00:27.652
All: SpongeBob SquarePants!
&gt;&gt; Ready?
全部：海绵宝宝！
>> 准备好了吗？

00:27.736 --> 00:29.863
All: SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：海绵宝宝！

00:29.946 --> 00:31.614
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:31.698 --> 00:33.783
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:33.867 --> 00:34.993
&gt;&gt; SpongeBob
>> 海绵宝宝

00:35.076 --> 00:37.203
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:39.914 --> 00:42.000
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:48.298 --> 00:53.595
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:57.265 --> 01:01.227
&gt;&gt; Get up, Patrick.
It's time!
>> 站起来，帕特里克。
是时候了！

01:01.311 --> 01:04.063
&gt;&gt; Time for what?
>> 时间做什么？

01:04.147 --> 01:05.940
&gt;&gt; The big shindig, remember?
>> 那场盛大的盛事，还记得吗？

01:06.024 --> 01:07.859
&gt;&gt; No.
>> 没有。

01:07.942 --> 01:11.571
Besides, I don't really think
my shins should be involved.
另外，我真的不认为
我的小腿应该也参与其中。

01:11.654 --> 01:13.907
They're a bit flabby today.
他们今天有点软弱。

01:13.990 --> 01:15.742
&gt;&gt; That's shindig, buddy.
>> 那真是太棒了，伙计。

01:15.825 --> 01:17.202
We're spending
the day at the beach
我们正在花费
在海滩的一天

01:17.285 --> 01:18.912
in honor of our best-friendship.
为了纪念我们最好的友谊。

01:18.995 --> 01:23.041
&gt;&gt; The beach?
Just you and me?
>> 海滩？
只有你和我吗？

01:23.124 --> 01:26.419
So am I ready for the beach,
SpongeBob?
那么我准备好去海滩了吗
海绵宝宝？

01:26.503 --> 01:28.171
&gt;&gt; Uh...sure.
>> 呃...当然。

01:28.254 --> 01:30.465
A little sunscreen,
and I'm sure you'll be fine.
涂一点防晒霜，
我相信你会没事的。

01:35.178 --> 01:36.971
&gt;&gt; I'm spending the whole day
at the beach
>> 我花了一整天的时间
在海滩上

01:37.055 --> 01:38.556
with my best friend.
和我最好的朋友。

01:40.683 --> 01:42.018
&gt;&gt; You're hurting me.
>> 你伤害了我。

01:45.104 --> 01:47.524
&gt;&gt; Guess what?
&gt;&gt; What?
>> 你猜怎么着？
>> 什么？

01:47.607 --> 01:50.401
&gt;&gt; I'm going to the beach
with my best friend!
>> 我要去海滩
和我最好的朋友！

01:52.028 --> 01:55.949
Oh, bus driver...
哦，公交车司机...

01:56.032 --> 01:57.408
&gt;&gt; What?
>> 什么？

01:57.492 --> 01:58.952
&gt;&gt; Okay, out of everyone
on this bus,
>> 好吧，从每个人中
在这辆巴士上，

01:59.035 --> 02:00.787
guess which one
is my best friend.
猜猜是哪一个
是我最好的朋友。

02:00.870 --> 02:02.372
&gt;&gt; I don't care.
>> 我不在乎。

02:02.455 --> 02:04.541
&gt;&gt; You know what this situation
calls for, Patrick?
>> 你知道这是什么情况吗
要求，帕特里克？

02:04.624 --> 02:07.293
A few verses
of the best friend tune.
几句诗
最好的朋友曲调。

02:07.377 --> 02:08.711
♪ Best friend... ♪
♪ 最好的朋友...♪

02:12.590 --> 02:13.675
Hey, wait!
嘿，等等！

02:13.758 --> 02:16.928
This is not our stop!
这不是我们的终点站！

02:17.011 --> 02:19.180
Oh, how are we gonna get
to the beach now, Patrick?
哦，我们要怎样才能得到
现在去海滩吗，帕特里克？

02:19.264 --> 02:20.849
We don't even know where we are.
我们甚至不知道自己在哪里。

02:20.932 --> 02:22.767
&gt;&gt; I knew it.
We've been abandoned!
>> 我就知道。
我们被抛弃了！

02:22.851 --> 02:25.478
&gt;&gt; Doomed!
Oh, you're right, Patrick.
>> 注定！
哦，你说得对，帕特里克。

02:25.562 --> 02:28.398
No one's ever gonna find us
out here.
没有人会找到我们
在这里。

02:31.651 --> 02:33.152
&gt;&gt; Little help, brah.
>> 没什么帮助，兄弟。

02:33.236 --> 02:34.779
&gt;&gt; Look, Patrick, we made it.
>> 看，帕特里克，我们成功了。

02:34.863 --> 02:39.617
Hey, best friend,
check this out.
嘿，最好的朋友，
看看这个。

02:39.701 --> 02:41.953
It's a small plastic disc
that you throw.
这是一个小塑料盘
你扔的。

02:42.036 --> 02:44.664
&gt;&gt; Small plastic disc
that you throw?
>> 小塑料盘
你扔的那个？

02:44.747 --> 02:47.667
I love playing small
plastic disc that you throw.
我喜欢玩小游戏
你扔的塑料盘。

02:47.750 --> 02:49.544
&gt;&gt; I do too, buddy.
>> 我也是，伙计。

02:49.627 --> 02:50.837
If only "small plastic disc
that you throw"
如果只是“小塑料盘
你扔的”

02:50.920 --> 02:52.839
had a shorter, catchier name.
有一个更短、更朗朗上口的名字。

02:52.922 --> 02:57.886
&gt;&gt; Oh, how about "small plastic
disc that you toss?"
>> 哦，“小塑料”怎么样？
你扔的光盘？”

02:57.969 --> 02:59.095
&gt;&gt; Perfect!
>> 完美！

02:59.178 --> 03:00.305
Now run along, Patrick,
现在跑吧，帕特里克，

03:00.388 --> 03:03.182
and I'll toss it to you.
我会把它扔给你。

03:03.266 --> 03:04.976
Ready?
准备好？

03:11.566 --> 03:14.319
&gt;&gt; That's why they call it
a sandwi--
>> 这就是为什么他们称之为
三明治——

03:25.663 --> 03:28.166
&gt;&gt; I caught it!
>> 我抓住了！

03:28.249 --> 03:30.209
Wasn't that cool, SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝，这不是很酷吗？

03:30.293 --> 03:33.212
&gt;&gt; I can assure you,
that was  not  cool.
>> 我可以向你保证，
那不酷。

03:33.296 --> 03:34.839
Just look at what you've done.
看看你做了什么。

03:34.923 --> 03:37.258
Your buffoonery has destroyed
the lifeguard tower.
你的滑稽表演已经毁了
救生塔。

03:37.342 --> 03:40.386
Why don't you find something
to do that's less obnoxious.
你为什么不找点东西
这样做就不那么令人讨厌了。

03:40.470 --> 03:41.429
&gt;&gt; Like what?
>> 比如什么？

03:41.512 --> 03:42.972
&gt;&gt; I don't know.
>> 我不知道。

03:43.056 --> 03:44.474
Go play in the sand
or something.
去玩沙子吧
或者什么的。

03:44.557 --> 03:46.225
&gt;&gt; Well, I don't know.
>> 嗯，我不知道。

03:46.309 --> 03:49.062
Playing with the sand sounds
pretty boring.
玩沙子的声音
很无聊。

03:49.145 --> 03:50.730
&gt;&gt; Nonsense, Patrick.
>> 胡说八道，帕特里克。

03:50.813 --> 03:52.899
There are plenty of fun things
to do in the sand.
还有很多好玩的事情
在沙子里做。

03:52.982 --> 03:57.236
We can draw, or practice
our cursive writing or--
我们可以画画，或者练习
我们的草书或——

03:57.320 --> 03:58.821
&gt;&gt; Boring, SpongeBob, boring.
>> 无聊，海绵宝宝，无聊。

03:58.905 --> 04:01.783
&gt;&gt; I know:
We can make sand castles!
>> 我知道：
我们可以做沙堡！

04:01.866 --> 04:04.744
&gt;&gt; That sounds un-boring.
>> 这听起来并不无聊。

04:04.827 --> 04:08.957
No one's ever been annoyed
by a sand castle.
没有人曾被激怒过
在一座沙堡旁边。

04:10.667 --> 04:13.795
&gt;&gt; Nothing quite like the joy
of sand-castling, eh, buddy?
>> 没有什么比快乐更重要的了
沙堡，嗯，伙计？

04:13.878 --> 04:15.713
How you doing over there?
你那边怎么样？

04:15.797 --> 04:18.633
&gt;&gt; Everything's dandy
in Patrick's kingdom.
>> 一切都很花花公子
在帕特里克的王国里。

04:21.135 --> 04:23.221
&gt;&gt; Oh, a structure like that
can't protect a king,
>> 哦，这样的结构
无法保护国王，

04:23.304 --> 04:24.389
and his subjects.
和他的臣民。

04:24.472 --> 04:25.890
Here, let me help you.
在这里，让我来帮助你。

04:25.974 --> 04:28.476
First, you should start
all over.
首先，你应该开始
一切都结束了。

04:28.559 --> 04:29.727
&gt;&gt; What are you doing?
>> 你在做什么？

04:29.811 --> 04:31.938
You destroyed my castle!
你毁了我的城堡！

04:32.021 --> 04:33.356
&gt;&gt; I'm just trying to help,
buddy.
>> 我只是想帮忙，
伙计。

04:33.439 --> 04:35.858
&gt;&gt; I don't need any help.
>> 我不需要任何帮助。

04:35.942 --> 04:37.777
&gt;&gt; Here are those architectural
plans you requested.
>> 这是那些建筑
您要求的计划。

04:37.860 --> 04:39.654
&gt;&gt; Why thank you.
>> 为什么要谢谢你。

04:39.737 --> 04:41.698
Here's a little something
for you.
这里有一点东西
为了你。

04:43.825 --> 04:46.452
&gt;&gt; I suppose I should just tend
to the affairs of my own realm.
>> 我想我应该倾向于
处理我自己领域的事务。

04:46.536 --> 04:52.125
And I'll start by making a queen
to rule by your side.
我将从做一个女王开始
在你身边统治。

04:52.208 --> 04:54.043
&gt;&gt; Now we're even.
>> 现在我们扯平了。

04:54.127 --> 04:56.963
&gt;&gt; All right, Patrick.
Have it your way.
>> 好吧，帕特里克。
随心所欲。

04:57.046 --> 04:59.674
You keep to your territory,
and I'll keep to mine.
你坚守自己的领地，
我会保留我的。

05:04.262 --> 05:07.473
&gt;&gt; This'll show SpongeBob
he's not the only one
>> 这将显示海绵宝宝
他不是唯一一个

05:07.557 --> 05:09.976
who can build a castle.
谁能建造一座城堡。

05:10.059 --> 05:13.354
Let's see SpongeBob
destroy  this  castle.
我们来看看海绵宝宝
摧毁这座城堡。

05:13.438 --> 05:15.106
&gt;&gt; I'd better build a wall
>> 我最好建一堵墙

05:15.189 --> 05:17.775
just in case King Pinky
gets any funny ideas.
以防万一 King Pinky
得到任何有趣的想法。

05:21.571 --> 05:25.074
Oh, sir, you built onto my side.
哦，先生，你站在我这边。

05:25.158 --> 05:26.200
&gt;&gt; So.
>> 那么。

05:26.284 --> 05:27.410
&gt;&gt; So you don't do that!
>> 所以你不要这样做！

05:30.163 --> 05:31.497
There.
那里。

05:31.581 --> 05:34.000
That restores the integrity
of our shared border.
这恢复了完整性
我们共同的边界。

05:34.083 --> 05:35.835
&gt;&gt; You tyrant!
You've done it again!
>>你这个暴君！
你又成功了！

05:35.918 --> 05:40.131
I'll show you what for.
我会告诉你有什么用。

05:40.214 --> 05:42.008
&gt;&gt; What for what?
&gt;&gt;
>> 为了什么？
>>

05:43.676 --> 05:46.179
&gt;&gt; Now we're even...again.
>> 现在我们……又扯平了。

05:46.262 --> 05:48.514
&gt;&gt; Okay, Patrick.
I can accept that.
>> 好的，帕特里克。
我可以接受。

05:48.598 --> 05:51.851
No more destruction
from this point forward, okay?
不再有破坏
从现在开始，好吗？

05:51.934 --> 05:55.313
Okay, back to square one again.
好吧，再次回到第一个方块。

06:05.281 --> 06:07.033
&gt;&gt; Uh-huh!
>> 嗯嗯！

06:10.161 --> 06:11.704
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

06:11.788 --> 06:13.956
I hereby propose
a non-aggression treaty
我在此提议
互不侵犯条约

06:14.040 --> 06:16.125
to end hostilities
between our two kingdoms.
结束敌对行动
我们两个王国之间。

06:18.753 --> 06:21.672
Patrick, by signing
this historic armistice,
帕特里克，通过签名
这场历史性的停战，

06:21.756 --> 06:23.216
you have brought peace
to our lands.
你带来了和平
到我们的土地。

06:23.299 --> 06:25.718
May your kingdom prosper.
愿你的王国繁荣昌盛。

06:25.802 --> 06:28.304
Well, that went well.
嗯，进展顺利。

06:28.387 --> 06:31.099
What are you doing?
What about the treaty?
你在干什么？
条约呢？

06:31.182 --> 06:35.436
&gt;&gt; This treaty ain't worth
the sand it's printed on.
>> 这个条约不值得
打印它的沙子。

06:35.520 --> 06:37.313
&gt;&gt; Oh, is that so?
>>哦，是这样吗？

06:37.396 --> 06:39.357
Well, if you think you can
take down this castle
好吧，如果你认为你可以
拿下这座城堡

06:39.440 --> 06:41.567
my answer is: bring it on!
我的回答是：加油！

06:41.651 --> 06:43.194
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

06:53.329 --> 06:56.958
&gt;&gt; Patrick, I'm trying
to be the nice guy here, okay?
>>帕特里克，我正在努力
成为这里的好人，好吗？

06:57.041 --> 06:58.584
Let's call
this silly business off.
我们打电话吧
这愚蠢的生意结束了。

06:58.668 --> 07:00.753
&gt;&gt; No way.
You started it.
>> 没办法。
你开始了。

07:00.837 --> 07:02.964
&gt;&gt; Fine!
Have it your way.
>> 好吧！
随心所欲。

07:03.047 --> 07:06.217
&gt;&gt;
Whatever.
>>
无论如何。

07:10.012 --> 07:11.722
No, no, no, no.
Ah.
不，不，不，不。
啊。

07:39.834 --> 07:42.461
Oh, hello,
and good-bye.
哦，你好，
再见。

07:46.007 --> 07:48.801
&gt;&gt; Uh-huh.
&gt;&gt;
>> 嗯嗯。
>>

07:48.885 --> 07:50.386
&gt;&gt; Come on!
>> 加油！

07:54.765 --> 07:56.267
How you like them apples?
你喜欢这些苹果吗？

08:05.193 --> 08:07.236
&gt;&gt;
You'll never win!
>>
你永远不会赢！

08:07.320 --> 08:08.571
Do you hear me?
你听到我说话了吗？

08:13.326 --> 08:14.827
&gt;&gt; Uh-huh.
>> 嗯嗯。

08:14.911 --> 08:16.037
Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。

08:16.120 --> 08:18.247
Well put, General.
说得好，将军。

08:18.331 --> 08:19.874
We'll create a surprise
military diversion
我们会创造惊喜
军事转移

08:19.957 --> 08:21.334
and break through enemy lines.
并突破敌军防线。

08:21.417 --> 08:22.418
What say you?
你说什么？

08:24.086 --> 08:25.838
Yes, we shall ready ourselves
immediately.
是的，我们要做好准备
立即。

08:33.888 --> 08:35.431
How do you like me now?
你现在喜欢我怎么样？

08:37.433 --> 08:39.227
&gt;&gt; I like you this much.
>> 我非常喜欢你。

08:44.524 --> 08:45.566
&gt;&gt; Whoa!
>> 哇！

08:46.567 --> 08:48.319
&gt;&gt; Feel me!
>> 感受我！

08:57.995 --> 08:59.247
&gt;&gt; Patrick?
>> 帕特里克？

09:00.456 --> 09:01.624
Patrick!
帕特里克！

09:01.707 --> 09:02.959
Are you okay?
你还好吗？

09:03.042 --> 09:06.128
&gt;&gt; Question is: will you be?
>> 问题是：你愿意吗？

09:14.971 --> 09:17.098
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

09:23.646 --> 09:24.897
&gt;&gt; No fair.
>> 不公平。

09:24.981 --> 09:26.399
&gt;&gt; All's fair in love and war,
>> 爱情和战争都是公平的，

09:26.482 --> 09:28.192
my friend/enemy.
我的朋友/敌人。

09:28.276 --> 09:30.861
Or should I say, my friendenemy?
或者我应该说，我的朋友敌人？

09:38.077 --> 09:41.372
Let's have some real fun.
让我们来点真正的乐趣吧。

09:43.666 --> 09:45.501
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

09:48.421 --> 09:50.256
&gt;&gt; What was that?
>> 那是什么？

09:50.339 --> 09:51.841
Come on,
we got to get out of here.
来吧，
我们必须离开这里。

09:51.924 --> 09:54.051
&gt;&gt; Grab the children!
>> 抓住孩子们！

09:56.095 --> 09:57.930
&gt;&gt; Oh, yeah?
>>哦，是吗？

09:58.014 --> 10:00.016
Two can play at this game.
这个游戏可以两个人玩。

10:09.317 --> 10:11.360
&gt;&gt; Jumping jellyfish!
Whoa!
>> 跳跃的水母！
哇！

10:22.705 --> 10:24.373
&gt;&gt; I wasn't gonna do this,
>> 我本来不想这么做的

10:24.457 --> 10:27.626
but you've left me no choice.
但你让我别无选择。

10:32.381 --> 10:35.301
&gt;&gt; Ah, let's beat it, dude.
>> 啊，让我们打败它吧，伙计。

10:40.890 --> 10:43.476
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

10:43.559 --> 10:45.019
Huh?
啊？

10:52.985 --> 10:56.489
&gt;&gt; Oh, what happened?
>>哦，发生什么事了？

10:56.572 --> 10:58.491
&gt;&gt; I'll tell you what happened,
Patrick.
>> 我来告诉你发生了什么事
帕特里克.

10:58.574 --> 10:59.992
I got carried away.
我得意忘形了。

11:00.076 --> 11:02.036
&gt;&gt; Me too.
>> 我也是。

11:02.119 --> 11:03.621
Was it worth it?
值得吗？

11:03.704 --> 11:05.790
&gt;&gt; No, no.
It wasn't.
>> 不，不。
事实并非如此。

