必须要擦进去吗？

20:53.460 --> 20:55.796
&gt;&gt; Hey, what's with
all that sniveling?
>> 嘿，怎么了
哭哭啼啼的？

20:55.879 --> 20:57.339
&gt;&gt; Mr. Krabs?
>> 蟹老板？

20:57.422 --> 20:59.216
What are you doing here?
你在这里做什么？

20:59.299 --> 21:01.927
&gt;&gt; I'm just--oh,
well, never mind that, boy.
>> 我只是——哦，
好吧，别介意，男孩。

21:02.010 --> 21:03.220
What's your problem?
你有什么问题吗？

21:03.303 --> 21:04.763
&gt;&gt; I destroyed Gary's shell,
>> 我摧毁了加里的外壳，

21:04.846 --> 21:06.890
and now I can't find
a replacement.
现在我找不到了
一个替代品。

21:06.974 --> 21:08.934
So I guess he'll just live
the rest of his days
所以我猜他会活下去
他的余生

21:09.017 --> 21:11.561
as a lowly slug.
作为一个卑微的蛞蝓。

21:14.690 --> 21:17.192
&gt;&gt; There, there, boy.
There there.
>> 那里，那里，男孩。
那里那里。

21:17.275 --> 21:18.777
It's not that bad.
没那么糟糕。

21:18.860 --> 21:21.113
I'm sure you'll think
of something.
我相信你会想
的某事。

21:21.196 --> 21:23.991
&gt;&gt; Mr. Krabs,
perhaps you could help me
>> 蟹老板先生，
也许你可以帮助我

21:24.074 --> 21:25.909
find a new shell for Gary.
为加里找到一个新的外壳。

21:25.993 --> 21:28.120
&gt;&gt; Well, I'd be honored to help
you and your sniveling snail
>> 嗯，我很荣幸能提供帮助
你和你的流鼻涕的蜗牛

21:28.203 --> 21:29.830
during such desperate times.
在如此绝望的时刻。

21:29.913 --> 21:33.417
Because I love helping others
by helping myself.
因为我喜欢帮助别人
通过帮助自己。

21:33.500 --> 21:35.794
Now how much ya got?
现在你有多少钱？

21:35.877 --> 21:37.004
&gt;&gt; Nothing, Mr. Krabs.
>> 没什么，蟹老板。

21:37.087 --> 21:38.088
I'm broke.
我破产了。

21:38.171 --> 21:40.799
&gt;&gt; Oh, I see.
>> 哦，我明白了。

21:40.882 --> 21:42.259
&gt;&gt; But wait, Mr. Krabs.
>> 但是等等，蟹老板。

21:42.342 --> 21:44.928
If you help me get Gary a shell,
如果你帮我给加里买一个贝壳

21:45.012 --> 21:47.347
I'll work for free for the rest
of the year.
剩下的时间我会免费工作
今年的。

21:47.431 --> 21:49.474
&gt;&gt; Only if I can cut
your health benefits for you.
>>只要我能剪
对您的健康有益。

21:49.558 --> 21:50.559
&gt;&gt; Deal!
>> 交易！

21:52.894 --> 21:56.398
&gt;&gt;
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>
>>

21:56.481 --> 21:59.234
Ah, another bad dream.
啊，又是一个噩梦。

22:02.029 --> 22:03.238
Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板？

22:04.698 --> 22:07.826
No, sorry, Gary,
I'm not used to your new shell.
不，对不起，加里，
我不习惯你的新外壳。

22:17.210 --> 22:18.920
&gt;&gt; SpongeBob, my boy.
>> 海绵宝宝，我的孩子。

22:19.004 --> 22:20.422
I need to borrow a blanket.
我需要借一条毯子。

22:20.505 --> 22:22.924
&gt;&gt; There you go, Mr. Krabs.
>> 好了，蟹老板。

22:23.008 --> 22:24.051
&gt;&gt; Thanks, boy-o.
>> 谢谢，小伙子。

22:24.134 --> 22:25.677
Now I'm all toasty.
现在我很高兴。

22:25.761 --> 22:30.057
&gt;&gt; Ah, I guess all's shell
that ends shell.
>> 啊，我猜都是外壳
外壳结束。

22:30.140 --> 22:32.934
Huh, Gary?
Ah! That's a good one.
哈，加里？
啊!这是一件好事。

22:33.018 --> 22:36.688
Gary. Gary. Gary.
加里.加里.加里.

